<title>UK: SOCCER-CHELSEA SIGN URUGUAYAN MIDFIELDER POYET.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHELSEA SIGN URUGUAYAN MIDFIELDER POYET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier league Chelsea have signed Uruguayan midfielder Gustavo Poyet from Spain's Real Zaragoza on a free transfer.</p>
<p>Poyet will join Chelsea on June 30.</p>
</text>
